# A local portable mpv, if one is copied in here for convenience.
#
# The whole folder, not just its caches. A 110 MB mpv.exe used to be committed
# through Git LFS and nothing ever read it -- mpv_root_candidates() looks at
# C:\mpv, ProgramFiles, ~/mpv, the AX Player runtime, scoop, chocolatey and
# PATH, never at the repo. GitHub's free LFS allowance is 1 GB of bandwidth a
# month, so that one file put a hard ceiling of roughly nine clones on the
# project before `git clone` started failing for everyone. Removed from
# history; this keeps it from coming back.
mpv/

